#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:16
#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:5
#: 64e0649bf459461996d9e75ded080ccc c10032642d9a47468ac371e619c310c8
msgid "Avionics Anonymous GNSS/Mag"
msgstr "Avionics Anonymous GNSS/罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:7
#: a18cc33f02ca4493a453e1960379cc62
msgid ""
"The `Avionics Anonymous GNSS/Mag "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/gnssmag>`__ is a high-"
"performance combination GPS and magnetometer for small unmanned vehicles. It"
" includes a uBlox SAM-M8Q integrated multi-constellation GNSS unit and a "
"high-quality Memsic MMC5983MA magnetometer enabling better than 1-degree "
"heading accuracy. The device interfaces to your autopilot via a robust "
"`DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ interface, which provides high "
"reliability connections to peripherals over greater distances than I2C."
msgstr ""
"`Avionics Anonymous GNSS/Mag "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/gnssmag>`__ 是一款用于小型无人机的高性能 GPS "
"与磁力计组合模块。内置 uBlox SAM-M8Q 多星座 GNSS 单元和高品质 Memsic MMC5983MA 磁力计，航向精度优于 1 "
"度。设备通过稳健的 `DroneCAN <https://dronecan.org>`__ 接口与飞控通信，比 I2C 提供更高可靠性和更远连接距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:18
#: 86932cf744ea49aca003c1a63ac2d2ca
msgid ""
"The following parameters should be set on the autopilot (and then reboot the"
" autopilot):"
msgstr "应在飞控上设置以下参数（然后重启飞控）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:20
#: fddda4025c35441b83bff13a04d1f79d
msgid ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1 (to enable the 1st CAN port)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER <CAN_P1_DRIVER>` = 1（启用第一路 CAN 端口）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:21
#: 0f37a823fb44471f978dd0f64411cc71
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 9 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 9（DroneCAN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:23
#: f0c2fd45123249d9a0330ad727e38730
msgid ""
"If the device does not work please follow the instructions on enabling the "
"CANBUS in the :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` page, followed by "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` steps and then set the :ref:`GPS1_TYPE "
"<GPS1_TYPE>` or :ref:`GPS2_TYPE <GPS2_TYPE>` parameter to 9."
msgstr ""
"如果设备无法工作，请按照 :ref:`common-canbus-setup-advanced` 页面上的 CANBUS 启用说明操作，然后执行 "
":ref:`common-uavcan-setup-advanced` 步骤，并将 :ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` 或 "
":ref:`GPS2_TYPE <GPS2_TYPE>` 参数设置为 9。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-avanon-gnss-mag.rst:25
#: d8df16245f0a4e80bc154af3243eaa8b
msgid ""
"The `manufacturer's product page is here "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/gnssmag>`__ for general "
"information about the device."
msgstr ""
"有关设备的一般信息，请访问 `制造商产品页面 "
"<https://docs.avionicsanonymous.com/devices/gnssmag>`__。"
